{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:00 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯半裸除剩底褲肉搏張智霖  袁詠儀親自監場睇實  Kelly一度拒拍陷僵局｜璀璨之城\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45eeb7d3a8fcfb50f50a6676ed51f268/2026-10/ENT___50.jpg\"/>\n<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》自開播以來多次成為網絡熱話，早前陳瀅在劇中「腿張開」讓張智霖拍攝的一幕已轟動全城，原來另一女主角張曦雯（Kelly）有着更震撼、更激烈的場面，跟張智霖上演一場長達7分鐘、大尺度除剩底褲的肉搏羞辱重頭戲，尺度之大令人咋舌。</p>\n<h2>臨場加碼張曦雯需除剩底褲</h2>\n<p>據悉這場極限挑戰要在鏡頭前「一Shot過」完成，張曦雯更要半裸上身，僅穿底褲與張智霖貼身肉搏。期間她還會被對方扯頭髮，極盡羞辱之能事。張曦雯透露，最初接獲劇本時只要求穿內衣褲上陣，尺度尚算溫和，沒料到正式拍攝時，監製陳維冠臨場加碼，要求挑戰超高難度的一鏡到底（One Take）大露背鏡頭。</p>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯於《璀璨之城》將半裸除剩底褲肉搏張智霖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8271fe433ddcd1d6c712988fe673edd8/2026-10/1_4_93.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯曾一度拒演，得袁詠儀及江美儀力勸接拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc23cb9abce06bd5c5c9db5ffcbc0854/2026-10/2_2_86.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯指該場戲被張智霖扯頭髮好羞辱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f36bbe7e6a3b578cd7ba56db1da27c7/2026-10/3_66.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯貢獻從影以來最性感演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce512bde038f1c7b6a63178f41f61ad2/2026-10/4_5_64.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖早前接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問，被問到與陳曉華拍激情戲的感想，他笑言作為專業演員，太太袁詠儀（靚靚）並無陪同「試戲」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4aade4276509ef2001824d95d534f399/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"但就有全家總動員一同觀看：「有呀，一齊睇，刺激嘛！拍嘅時候已經好刺激，睇嘅時候都好刺激㗎嘛。我覺得我緊張啲，成家人，外父外母……一齊睇，嘩！好好睇呀！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90c04759af23a760b0a431802754da67/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-2_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖更生動地描述觀後反應：「好似都有一聲……倒抽一口涼氣嘅聲音，一完咗……（深呼吸）……全家人！」他形容情慾戲過後，全家氣氛反而「好歡樂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0abcc1eb2f7c8a12477ad76eef7a76d/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》熱播中，剛播出即掀起話題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c394c256cba97a6e996cfe69e9c656a/2026-10/09_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與多名女角有感情線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f6d6dd7eacd621ed4a8d648883fbdf4/2026-10/17_2_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）好有艷福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/590c9febf1eb2233a5800c8c136f1473/2026-10/25_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）首集即與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）激烈擁吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14846d6c826ce6245c6bb8052a23a080/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_38_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）的手更從女方腰間游走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb818096cc437eedf20a637c9770076/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甚至伸入裙內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad716321577daae033c6bde0a6effa3b/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）狀甚享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cc0369563305eee71c83dfa8904d81a/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_53_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"角度相當曖昧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ead3c425881cb850ebb64a689ec42afa/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）雖然穿得密實，但二人互動卻相當有Feel。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/669cf6df9fe406411b87c8f9dc0f0acd/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華看上去極有袁詠儀年青時的樣子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7187adb60b5323715177787a839ab7a5/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_38_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張曦雯曾一口拒絕接拍</h2>\n<p>面對毫無預警的「脫衣指令」，張曦雯當場大感震驚，更因心理關口與尺度太大而一口拒絕，堅定表示：「No I don't think so, I'm not going to do it! 我唔拍，你哋自己Cut shot，我唔一Shot落。」令拍攝進度一度陷入僵局。</p>\n<h2>視后江美儀力勸接拍</h2>\n<p>其後劇組因修改劇本停工近3個月。復拍期間，張智霖太太袁詠儀（靚靚）前來探班，並與江美儀、張曦雯等人一同聚餐。席間眾人重提這場重頭戲，視后江美儀隨即展現專業風範，向張曦雯耐心剖析角色，指出此幕大尺度犧牲能令角色更加立體，並苦口婆心勸說：「拍啦，阿女，你應該要拍。」</p>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，見面時先交出手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de424f6f6c84f9891313000cd918532/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-39_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83743d39e7bdff9a3ca23bbdcf29ea5a/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動除衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅先露出黑bra。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅再除下牛仔褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅露出蜜桃臀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b60bf2304a1174ede90d77d2272bf24f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖一臉嫌棄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a392d28d7c5b83b89ec34e6d6353ea/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅繼續出招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af8eec1a8833823d1ededd8c650d96d9/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖冷眼看陳瀅下一步行動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1c10c13a7b96c17a14dcbb4ad8b6ee0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備坐在床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cecd73e938289986dabac79ba39a60f3/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備除下內褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8149e85dc649e4f12896e9152e9fd23f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅解開胸罩背扣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4b85d35644c9fbb3f1b10702f44edce/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb8f8e39a22a94262b1e4541a6ac078/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅即將一絲不掛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6c2e91f929731a4b6aee6e1e55d2f7f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將身上衣物全數脫光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aca8a442d4b89f2bc87ddb838be0aa61/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅任影唔嬲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bfaf8f92d5af7d2835c6620e6a2455c/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583bea3e5581a451cd8e3929fb751ac0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca90a71763a069064ec774e63063377/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_05_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>袁詠儀親自監場</h2>\n<p>而同場的袁詠儀亦大派定心丸，承諾拍攝當日會親自到場「監場」並幫忙清場，確保私隱。獲兩位重量級前輩合力遊說與開導後，張曦雯終衝破心理防線，翌日主動向監製答應親身上陣，奉獻出入行以來最性感、最大膽的演出。</p>\n<h2>張智霖「扯髮」助入戲</h2>\n<p>這場長達7分鐘、足足有5頁紙對白的重頭戲，單是排位已耗時近3小時。拍攝時，張曦雯除了要克服半裸的赤裸感，更要演繹極致的情緒崩潰。她事後特別感激對手張智霖的專業帶領：「佢好畀到戲對手，嗰場戲個情緒係好羞辱，拍攝時佢撥開我嘅頭髮同扯咗我一下頭髮，我嘅眼淚就忍唔住出嚟，覺得好侮辱。」在張智霖的引導與袁詠儀的監場守護下，這場備受矚目的極限虐心戲最終順利完成。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:20:46.980127+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":888,"images":39,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:18:10.648819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:17:42.192572+00:00","content_hash":"b62e6f7f8f83d46bc8de74ba848cde1de12fdba71897ad91a266b05f23ee5395","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}